Menu="Utilities"
Title="UGREEN LEDs"
Icon="ugreenleds-driver.png"
---
<?php
$plugin = "ugreenleds-driver";
$cfg = array_merge(
  parse_ini_file("/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/$plugin/default.cfg") ?: [],
  parse_ini_file("/boot/config/plugins/$plugin/settings.cfg") ?: []
);

// renders a color picker backed by a hidden "R G B" field
function led_color($cfg, $key) {
  $rgb = array_map('intval', preg_split('/\s+/', trim($cfg[$key] ?? '0 0 0')));
  $hex = sprintf('#%02x%02x%02x', $rgb[0] ?? 0, $rgb[1] ?? 0, $rgb[2] ?? 0);
  return "<input type=\"color\" class=\"led-color\" value=\"$hex\" data-key=\"$key\">".
         "<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$key\" value=\"".htmlspecialchars($cfg[$key] ?? '')."\">";
}
?>
<script>
$(function() {
  $('.led-color').on('input change', function() {
    var h = $(this).val();
    var rgb = [1, 3, 5].map(function(i) { return parseInt(h.substr(i, 2), 16); }).join(' ');
    $('input[name="' + $(this).data('key') + '"]').val(rgb);
    $(this.form).find('input[name="#apply"]').prop('disabled', false);
  });
  $('select[name="NETDEV_MODE"]').on('change', toggleMode);
  toggleMode();
});
function toggleMode() {
  var status = $('select[name="NETDEV_MODE"]').val() == 'status';
  $('.mode-status').toggle(status);
  $('.mode-speed').toggle(!status);
}
</script>

<form markdown="1" name="ugreenleds_settings" method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
<input type="hidden" name="#file" value="<?=$plugin?>/settings.cfg">
<input type="hidden" name="#command" value="/plugins/<?=$plugin?>/scripts/restart">

<div markdown="1" class="title"><span class="left">_(Network / status LED)_</span></div>

_(Network LED mode)_:
: <select name="NETDEV_MODE">
  <?=mk_option($cfg['NETDEV_MODE'], "status", _("Status (unRAID notifications)"))?>
  <?=mk_option($cfg['NETDEV_MODE'], "speed", _("Link speed (original)"))?>
  </select>

> **Status:** OK color without problems, warning color while unread warnings exist, alert color for unread alerts or unreachable gateway. Archiving the notifications resets the LED.
> **Link speed:** color by link speed, red if the gateway is unreachable, flashes on traffic.

_(Check gateway connectivity)_:
: <select name="CHECK_GATEWAY_CONNECTIVITY">
  <?=mk_option($cfg['CHECK_GATEWAY_CONNECTIVITY'], "true", _("Yes"))?>
  <?=mk_option($cfg['CHECK_GATEWAY_CONNECTIVITY'], "false", _("No"))?>
  </select>

_(Gateway check interval)_ (_(seconds)_):
: <input type="number" name="CHECK_NETDEV_INTERVAL" min="5" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['CHECK_NETDEV_INTERVAL'])?>" class="narrow">

<div markdown="1" class="mode-status">
_(React to notifications)_:
: <select name="STATUS_NOTIFY_LEVEL">
  <?=mk_option($cfg['STATUS_NOTIFY_LEVEL'], "warning", _("Warnings and alerts"))?>
  <?=mk_option($cfg['STATUS_NOTIFY_LEVEL'], "alert", _("Alerts only"))?>
  <?=mk_option($cfg['STATUS_NOTIFY_LEVEL'], "off", _("Off (gateway only)"))?>
  </select>

_(Flash on network activity)_:
: <select name="NETDEV_BLINK_ACTIVITY">
  <?=mk_option($cfg['NETDEV_BLINK_ACTIVITY'], "false", _("No"))?>
  <?=mk_option($cfg['NETDEV_BLINK_ACTIVITY'], "true", _("Yes"))?>
  </select>

_(Status check interval)_ (_(seconds)_):
: <input type="number" name="CHECK_STATUS_INTERVAL" min="1" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['CHECK_STATUS_INTERVAL'])?>" class="narrow">

_(Color OK)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_STATUS_OK')?>

_(Color warning)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_STATUS_WARNING')?>

_(Color alert)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_STATUS_ALERT')?>
</div>

<div markdown="1" class="mode-speed">
_(Color unknown speed)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_NETDEV_NORMAL')?>

_(Color 100 Mbit)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_NETDEV_LINK_100')?>

_(Color 1 Gbit)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_NETDEV_LINK_1000')?>

_(Color 2.5 Gbit)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_NETDEV_LINK_2500')?>

_(Color 10 Gbit)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_NETDEV_LINK_10000')?>

_(Color gateway unreachable)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_NETDEV_GATEWAY_UNREACHABLE')?>
</div>

<div markdown="1" class="title"><span class="left">_(Disk LEDs)_</span></div>

_(Disk mapping method)_:
: <select name="MAPPING_METHOD">
  <?=mk_option($cfg['MAPPING_METHOD'], "ata", "ata")?>
  <?=mk_option($cfg['MAPPING_METHOD'], "hctl", "hctl")?>
  <?=mk_option($cfg['MAPPING_METHOD'], "serial", "serial")?>
  </select>

_(Disk serials)_ (_(serial mapping only)_):
: <input type="text" name="DISK_SERIAL" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['DISK_SERIAL'])?>">

_(Color healthy)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_DISK_HEALTH')?>

_(Color unavailable)_:
: <?=led_color($cfg, 'COLOR_DISK_UNAVAIL')?>

_(Brightness)_ (0-255):
: <input type="number" name="BRIGHTNESS_DISK_LEDS" min="0" max="255" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['BRIGHTNESS_DISK_LEDS'])?>" class="narrow">

_(Activity refresh interval)_ (_(seconds)_):
: <input type="text" name="LED_REFRESH_INTERVAL" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['LED_REFRESH_INTERVAL'])?>" class="narrow">

_(Disk online check interval)_ (_(seconds)_):
: <input type="number" name="CHECK_DISK_ONLINE_INTERVAL" min="1" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['CHECK_DISK_ONLINE_INTERVAL'])?>" class="narrow">

<input type="submit" name="#default" value="_(Default)_">
: <span class="inline-block">
    <input type="submit" name="#apply" value="_(Apply)_" disabled>
    <input type="button" value="_(Done)_" onclick="done()">
  </span>
</form>
